---
// Standalone Presentation Mini-App: Rocksurv Field
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
  <title>Rocksurv Field - Interactive App Presentation</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Interactive Rocksurv Field presentation: geology and geochemical sampling, offline maps, terrain profiles and sample handover.">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --paper: #f5f7f2;
      --ink: #12352e;
      --muted: #50645d;
      --mint: #69d4ad;
      --line: #cbd7cd;
      --gold: #d6b879;
      --bg: #0e1714;
      --bar-bg: rgba(16, 39, 31, 0.94);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html, body {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, Arial, sans-serif;
      overflow: hidden;
      user-select: none;
      -webkit-user-select: none;
    }
    button { font: inherit; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; }

    /* Top Bar */
    .pres-bar {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 52px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 16px;
      background: var(--bar-bg);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(105, 212, 173, 0.2);
      z-index: 100;
      color: #f5f7f2;
      transition: opacity 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
    }
    .pres-bar-left, .pres-bar-right {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .pres-back {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      border-radius: 6px;
      color: #f5f7f2;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .pres-back:hover {
      background: rgba(105, 212, 173, 0.22);
      border-color: var(--mint);
      color: #fff;
    }
    .pres-title-wrap {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .pres-app-title {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 15px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      color: #fff;
    }
    .pres-chip {
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      padding: 2px 7px;
      background: rgba(105, 212, 173, 0.16);
      color: var(--mint);
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .lang-toggle {
      display: inline-flex;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 2px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    }
    .lang-btn {
      border: none;
      background: transparent;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: #9ab4a8;
      transition: all 0.18s ease;
    }
    .lang-btn.active {
      background: var(--mint);
      color: #0e1714;
    }
    .tool-btn {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .tool-btn:hover {
      background: rgba(105, 212, 173, 0.2);
      border-color: var(--mint);
    }

    /* Main Stage */
    #pres-container {
      position: absolute;
      top: 52px;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    #stage {
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      top: 50%;
      width: 1600px;
      height: 900px;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(var(--scale, 1));
      transform-origin: center center;
      transition: transform 0.08s ease-out;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    }

    .slide {
      display: none;
      position: relative;
      width: 1600px;
      height: 900px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--paper);
      padding: 60px 70px;
    }
    .slide.active { display: block; }

    .deck { display: none; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
    .deck.active-deck { display: block; }

    /* Typography & Layout */
    .brandline {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }
    .brandline .brand {
      font-size: 25px;
      letter-spacing: -.5px;
      font-weight: 750;
    }
    .eyebrow { color: var(--muted); }
    h1, h2, p { margin: 0; }
    h2 {
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: -1.8px;
      font-size: 57px;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin: 30px 0 16px;
      max-width: 1460px;
    }
    .lead {
      font-size: 27px;
      line-height: 1.35;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 1450px;
    }
    .feature-content {
      position: absolute;
      left: 70px;
      right: 70px;
      top: 258px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 420px 960px;
      gap: 80px;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .copy { padding-top: 2px; max-width: 390px; }
    .point {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding-top: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 31px;
    }
    .point h3 {
      margin: 0 0 9px;
      font-size: 27px;
      font-weight: 650;
      line-height: 1.14;
      letter-spacing: -.5px;
    }
    .point p {
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.35;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .shot {
      position: relative;
      margin: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      aspect-ratio: 2560 / 1410;
      background: #dfe9e1;
      outline: 1px solid #b9c9bd;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 28px #17372a12;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .shot img {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      transform: none;
      display: block;
    }
    .caption {
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.3;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .footer {
      position: absolute;
      left: 70px;
      right: 70px;
      bottom: 22px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding-top: 12px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 40px;
      font-size: 16px;
      letter-spacing: .4px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* Portrait Slides */
    .portrait-slide h2 { max-width: 920px; }
    .portrait-slide .lead { max-width: 850px; }
    .portrait-slide .feature-content { top: 350px; display: block; }
    .portrait-slide .copy { max-width: 760px; }
    .portrait-slide .point { margin-bottom: 31px; }
    .portrait-slide .portrait-visual {
      position: absolute;
      right: 70px;
      top: 125px;
      width: 430px;
    }
    .shot.portrait { aspect-ratio: 5 / 8; }
    .shot.portrait img { height: 100%; object-fit: contain; transform: none; }
    .portrait-slide > .caption {
      position: absolute;
      left: 70px;
      top: 755px;
      width: 820px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* Cover Slide */
    .cover {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--paper);
    }
    .cover .eyebrow, .cover .footer { color: #a9c6b7; }
    .cover .footer { border-color: #38584b; }
    .cover .brandline .brand { font-size: 30px; }
    .cover h1 {
      font-size: 82px;
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -3px;
      font-weight: 650;
      position: absolute;
      top: 222px;
      left: 70px;
      width: 510px;
    }
    .cover h1 span { display: block; color: var(--mint); }
    .cover .tagline {
      position: absolute;
      top: 478px;
      left: 70px;
      width: 452px;
      font-size: 31px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #d5e4db;
    }
    .cover .hero-shot {
      position: absolute;
      left: 610px;
      right: 70px;
      top: 249px;
    }
    .cover .hero-shot .shot {
      outline: 1px solid #5d7b68;
      box-shadow: 0 22px 45px #0004;
    }
    .cover .hero-shot .caption {
      color: #b6cfc0;
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 21px;
    }
    .cover .cover-tag {
      position: absolute;
      left: 70px;
      top: 727px;
      width: 420px;
      color: var(--mint);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      letter-spacing: .3px;
    }

    /* Closing Slide */
    .closing { background: #eaf1e7; }
    .closing .cta {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.25;
      font-weight: 650;
      color: #126750;
    }
    .closing .point { margin-bottom: 21px; }
    .closing .point p { font-size: 23px; }
    .closing .caption { max-width: 1000px; }
    .closing .shot { aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; }
    .closing .shot img { height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transform: none; }

    /* Languages Slide */
    .languages {
      height: 529px;
      padding: 0;
      background: transparent;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .lang-row {
      position: relative;
      isolation: isolate;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 0;
      background: #e5eee5;
      padding: 0 36px;
      gap: 48px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-start;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 0;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .lang-row .flag-background {
      position: absolute;
      right: 0;
      top: 0;
      width: 310px;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: contain;
      opacity: .52;
      z-index: -1;
    }
    .lang-row span {
      width: 60px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #50645d;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }
    .lang-row strong {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100%;
      font-size: 62px;
      line-height: 1;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .lang-row strong.ar { line-height: 1; font-size: 62px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; }
    .platforms {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      margin-top: 12px;
      background: var(--ink);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 16px 0;
    }
    .platform {
      height: 94px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: .2px;
      color: var(--paper);
    }
    .platform + .platform { border-left: 1px solid #38584b; }
    .platform-art {
      height: 57px;
      width: 76px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .platform-art img { width: 68px; height: 68px; object-fit: contain; }
    .platform-art.ios img { width: 39px; height: 47px; }
    .language-slide .point { margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .language-slide .point p { font-size: 23px; }

    /* Bottom Navigation Controls */
    .controls {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 16px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: var(--bar-bg);
      border: 1px solid rgba(105, 212, 173, 0.3);
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      z-index: 90;
      color: #f5f7f2;
      font-size: 13px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      transition: opacity .25s ease;
    }
    .controls.quiet { opacity: 0.18; }
    .controls:hover, .controls:focus-within { opacity: 1; }
    .controls button {
      color: inherit;
      background: transparent;
      border: 0;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      cursor: pointer;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: background 0.18s ease;
    }
    .controls button:hover, .controls button:focus-visible {
      background: #355e4a;
      outline: 1px solid var(--mint);
    }
    .controls output {
      min-width: 60px;
      text-align: center;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    /* Progress bar */
    .pres-progress {
      position: fixed;
      top: 52px;
      left: 0;
      height: 3px;
      background: var(--mint);
      width: 0%;
      transition: width 0.25s ease;
      z-index: 101;
    }

    /* Keyboard help tooltip */
    .keys-hint {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #8da59b;
      margin-left: 6px;
      padding-left: 8px;
      border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .pres-title-wrap, .keys-hint { display: none; }
      .pres-bar { padding-inline: 8px; gap: 8px; }
      .pres-bar-left { gap: 8px; min-width: 0; }
      .pres-bar-right { gap: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; }
      .controls { white-space: nowrap; }
      .controls button { min-width: 44px; min-height: 44px; }
    }

    @media print {
      @page { size: 1600px 900px; margin: 0; }
      html, body {
        width: 1600px;
        height: auto;
        background: white;
        -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
        print-color-adjust: exact;
      }
      .pres-bar, .controls, .pres-progress { display: none !important; }
      #pres-container { position: static; display: block; }
      #stage { position: static; transform: none; width: 1600px; height: auto; }
      .slide, .slide.active {
        display: block !important;
        break-after: page;
        page-break-after: always;
      }
      .slide:last-child { break-after: auto; page-break-after: auto; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Top Navigation Bar -->
  <header class="pres-bar">
    <div class="pres-bar-left">
      <a href="/en/#apps" class="pres-back" id="back-link">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        <span>Back to CV</span>
      </a>
      <div class="pres-title-wrap">
        <span class="pres-app-title">Rocksurv Field</span>
        <span class="pres-chip">17 slides</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pres-bar-right">
      <div class="lang-toggle" role="group" aria-label="Presentation language">
        <button class="lang-btn active" id="btn-lang-ru" data-lang="ru">RU</button>
        <button class="lang-btn" id="btn-lang-en" data-lang="en">EN</button>
      </div>
      <button class="tool-btn" id="full" title="Full screen (F)">
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 3H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3m18 0V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3m0 18h3a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-3M3 16v3a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3"/></svg>
      </button>
      <button class="tool-btn" id="print" title="Print / PDF (P)">
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9V2h12v7M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"/><path d="M6 14h12v8H6z"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="pres-progress" id="progress-bar"></div>

  <!-- Stage -->
  <div id="pres-container">
    <main id="stage">
      <div class="deck" id="deck-ru">
        <section class="slide cover active" aria-label="1. Rocksurv Field"><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">ОБЗОР ПРИЛОЖЕНИЯ</span></div><h1>Rocksurv<span>Field</span></h1><p class="tagline">Современное приложение<br>для геологических<br>и геохимических работ.</p><div class="hero-shot"><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/01-1920.webp" alt="Rocksurv Field" srcset="/presentations/field/01-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/01-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/01-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Карты, полевые данные и инструменты рельефа в одном приложении.</p></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>01 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="2. Векторные и растровые данные вместе."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">01 / КАРТЫ ПРОЕКТА</span></div><h2>Векторные и растровые данные вместе.</h2><p class="lead">Объедините карты и маршруты в одном рабочем пространстве.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Данные вашего проекта</h3><p>Открывайте векторные и растровые слои из GeoPackage.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Настройте карту</h3><p>Видимость, прозрачность, легенды и сведения об объектах.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Маршруты на карте</h3><p>Добавляйте маршруты KML / KMZ к геологическим слоям.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/02-1920.webp" alt="Vector and raster data, together." srcset="/presentations/field/02-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/02-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/02-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Карты проекта в одном GeoPackage — удобное управление прямо в RS Field.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>02 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="3. Геология и геохимия в одном приложении."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">02 / ПОЛЕВЫЕ РЕЖИМЫ</span></div><h2>Геология и геохимия в одном приложении.</h2><p class="lead">Выберите нужный режим перед началом полевых работ.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Геологическая съёмка</h3><p>Наблюдения, структуры, изменения, пробы и фотографии.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Геохимический отбор</h3><p>План пунктов, отбор, журнал и подготовка партий проб.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Общие инструменты</h3><p>Карты, рельеф и защита данных доступны в обоих режимах.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/03-1920.webp" alt="Geology and geochemistry, together." srcset="/presentations/field/03-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/03-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/03-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Выберите режим в настройках — на маршруте остаются только нужные инструменты.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>03 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="4. Три типа точек в активной сессии"><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">03 / АКТИВНАЯ СЕССИЯ</span></div><h2>Три типа точек в активной сессии</h2><p class="lead">Собирайте подробные геологические данные в рамках полевой сессии.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Точка наблюдения</h3><p>Координаты, породы, состав, текстуры, пробы, фото и описание.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Структура</h3><p>Плоскостные и линейные замеры, ориентировка и связанные материалы.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Изменения / минерализация</h3><p>Минералы, типы изменений, интенсивность, форма и контекст.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/04-1920.webp" alt="Three record types in an Active Session" srcset="/presentations/field/04-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/04-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/04-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Одна сессия объединяет наблюдения и материалы всего маршрута.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>04 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="5. Ориентируйтесь уверенно на маршруте."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">04 / ОРИЕНТИРОВАНИЕ</span></div><h2>Ориентируйтесь уверенно на маршруте.</h2><p class="lead">Используйте компас, GNSS и геологическую карту вместе.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Направление по компасу</h3><p>Азимут, сторона света и показатель качества направления.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Положение на карте</h3><p>Используйте доступную GNSS-позицию и её точность.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Подготовка маршрута</h3><p>Стройте и сохраняйте линии профилей прямо на карте.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/05-1920.webp" alt="Keep your bearing in the field." srcset="/presentations/field/05-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/05-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/05-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Направление, местоположение и карта съёмки — в одном рабочем окне.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>05 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="6. Умная классификация и нужные поля."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">05 / КЛАССИФИКАЦИЯ ПОРОД</span></div><h2>Умная классификация и нужные поля.</h2><p class="lead">Тип породы определяет доступные варианты в геологической карточке.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Подсказки названий</h3><p>Геологические правила учитывают тип и введённый состав.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Подходящие варианты</h3><p>Текстуры, компоненты и признаки подходят группе пород.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Связанные описания</h3><p>Собирайте черновик из описаний фото и ссылок на материалы.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/06-1920.webp" alt="Smart classification, focused fields." srcset="/presentations/field/06-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/06-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/06-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Меньше поиска среди лишних полей — больше внимания описанию обнажения.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>06 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="7. Замеры структур и связанные материалы."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">06 / СТРУКТУРНАЯ ГЕОЛОГИЯ</span></div><h2>Замеры структур и связанные материалы.</h2><p class="lead">Сохраняйте ориентировку вместе с геологическим контекстом.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Плоскости и линейность</h3><p>Азимут и угол падения, линейные структурные замеры.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Расчёт простирания</h3><p>Простирание по британскому правилу правой руки.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Автоматические ссылки</h3><p>Ссылки на фото и зарисовки дополняют редактируемый текст.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/07-1920.webp" alt="Measured structures, linked evidence." srcset="/presentations/field/07-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/07-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/07-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Каждый замер связан с наблюдением и подтверждающими изображениями.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>07 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="8. Фотографии с геологическими деталями."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">07 / ФОТОДОКУМЕНТАЦИЯ</span></div><h2>Фотографии с геологическими деталями.</h2><p class="lead">Сохраняйте ценность фотографии через подробное описание и связи.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Подробные подписи</h3><p>Геологические детали, масштаб и направление съёмки.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Контекст в шаблонах</h3><p>Используйте сведения о породах, текстурах и структурах.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Связанные записи</h3><p>Автоссылки на фото и зарисовки в описании точек и структур.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/08-1280.webp" alt="Photos with geological detail." srcset="/presentations/field/08-640.webp 640w, /presentations/field/08-1280.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="1586" height="992" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Превратите полевое фото в содержательную запись для работы в офисе.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>08 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="9. Опишите то, что видите в поле."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">08 / ИЗМЕНЕНИЯ И МИНЕРАЛИЗАЦИЯ</span></div><h2>Опишите то, что видите в поле.</h2><p class="lead">Отдельные связанные записи для изменений и минерализации.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Детали изменений</h3><p>Тип изменения, интенсивность и форма проявления.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Детали минерализации</h3><p>Минералы, формы проявления и геологические связи.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Положение на карте</h3><p>Связь с наблюдением и собственные координаты точки.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/09-1920.webp" alt="Describe what you see in the field." srcset="/presentations/field/09-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/09-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/09-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Фиксируйте важные детали сразу, пока обнажение перед вами.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>09 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="10. Спутниковая карта онлайн и офлайн."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">09 / СПУТНИКОВЫЕ КАРТЫ</span></div><h2>Спутниковая карта онлайн и офлайн.</h2><p class="lead">Подготовьте обзорную подложку для района полевых работ.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Sentinel-2 RGB</h3><p>Естественные цвета: мозаика 2021 года, пиксель 10 м.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Выберите участок</h3><p>Видимая область или границы WGS84 и масштаб загрузки.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Работайте автономно</h3><p>Выберите готовый участок и просматривайте его без интернета.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/10-1920.webp" alt="Satellite context, online or offline." srcset="/presentations/field/10-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/10-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/10-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Скачайте район до выезда — и сохраняйте обзор местности без связи.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>10 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="11. Высоты доступны без интернета."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">10 / ВЫСОТЫ БЕЗ ИНТЕРНЕТА</span></div><h2>Высоты доступны без интернета.</h2><p class="lead">Используйте свои изогипсы или заранее скачайте открытые DEM.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Свои изогипсы</h3><p>RS Field оценивает высоту по настроенным изогипсам.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Открытые источники DEM</h3><p>Скачивайте нужное покрытие рельефа внутри приложения.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Изогипсы с GNSS</h3><p>Дополняйте высоту по изогипсам доступной высотой GNSS.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/11-1920.webp" alt="Keep elevation available offline." srcset="/presentations/field/11-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/11-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/11-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Подготовьте рельеф заранее — высоты останутся доступны вне зоны связи.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>11 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="12. Сохраните линию. Изучите рельеф."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">11 / ВЫСОТНЫЕ ПРОФИЛИ</span></div><h2>Сохраните линию. Изучите рельеф.</h2><p class="lead">Стройте высотный профиль по сохранённой линии из DEM или изогипс.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Сохранённые линии</h3><p>Сохраняйте профили; меняйте вершины, цвет и толщину.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Рельеф в контексте</h3><p>Изучайте график и связанное с ним положение на карте.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Три вида расстояний</h3><p>Сравнивайте горизонталь, наклонные отрезки и длину по рельефу.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/12-1920.webp" alt="Save the line. Understand the terrain." srcset="/presentations/field/12-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/12-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/12-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Учитывайте, как рельеф меняет расстояния вдоль намеченного маршрута.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>12 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="13. Геохимия: от плана к пробе."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">12 / ПОЛЕВАЯ ГЕОХИМИЯ</span></div><h2>Геохимия: от плана к пробе.</h2><p class="lead">Отдельный процесс для донных осадков и потоков рассеяния.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>План и фактическое место</h3><p>Импорт CSV / точечного GeoPackage и подтверждение места отбора.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Условия и методика</h3><p>Условия русла, методика, материал, масса и фракция.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Обычный или составной отбор</h3><p>Частичные отборы, материалы и фото связаны с пробой.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/13-1920.webp" alt="Geochemical exploration from plan to sample." srcset="/presentations/field/13-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/13-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/13-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">План отбора, полевые условия и номер пробы сохраняются вместе.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>13 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="14. Прослеживайте передачу каждой пробы."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">13 / ПЕРЕДАЧА ПРОБ</span></div><h2>Прослеживайте передачу каждой пробы.</h2><p class="lead">Контрольные образцы, версии партий и записи передачи под контролем.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Учёт контрольных образцов</h3><p>Регистрируйте дубликаты, бланки и стандарты со связями.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Фиксированные версии партий</h3><p>Материалы, упаковки и инструкции получателю.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Передача и приёмка</h3><p>Учёт выбранных позиций, расхождений и истории исправлений.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/14-1920.webp" alt="Trace every sample through handover." srcset="/presentations/field/14-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/14-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/14-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Знайте, какие материалы переданы, приняты и требуют уточнения.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>14 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="15. Подготовьте полевые данные к передаче."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">14 / ИЗ ПОЛЯ В ОФИС</span></div><h2>Подготовьте полевые данные к передаче.</h2><p class="lead">Выгружайте структурированные записи и сохраняйте полевой архив.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Выгрузка геологии</h3><p>Excel, доступные фото/зарисовки и отчёт проверки в ZIP.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Пакеты геохимии</h3><p>Внутренний архив и отдельная ведомость для лаборатории.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Защита данных</h3><p>Статус сохранения, история изменений и резервные копии.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/15-1920.webp" alt="Make field data ready for handover." srcset="/presentations/field/15-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/15-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/15-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Передавайте упорядоченные записи и сохраняйте копию для своей команды.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>15 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide language-slide" aria-label="16. Интерфейс для международных команд."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">15 / ЯЗЫКИ И ПЛАТФОРМЫ</span></div><h2>Интерфейс для международных команд.</h2><p class="lead">Меняйте язык интерфейса, сохраняя привычный рабочий процесс.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Быстрая локализация</h3><p>Выберите английский, русский или арабский в настройках.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Единые полевые инструменты</h3><p>Те же геологические и геохимические процессы.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Доступность платформ</h3><p>Сборка показана на Android. Выпуск iOS требует подтверждения.</p></div><div class="platforms"><div class="platform"><div class="platform-art android"><img src="/presentations/field/assets/android.svg" alt="Android" loading="lazy"></div><span>Android</span></div><div class="platform"><div class="platform-art ios"><img src="/presentations/field/assets/apple.svg" alt="iOS" loading="lazy"></div><span>iOS</span></div></div></div><div><div class="languages"><div class="lang-row"><img class="flag-background" src="/presentations/field/assets/flag_gb.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"><span>EN</span><strong lang="en" class="en" dir="ltr">English</strong></div><div class="lang-row"><img class="flag-background" src="/presentations/field/assets/flag_ru.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"><span>RU</span><strong lang="ru" class="ru" dir="ltr">Русский</strong></div><div class="lang-row"><img class="flag-background" src="/presentations/field/assets/flag_sa.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"><span>AR</span><strong lang="ar" class="ar" dir="rtl">العربية</strong></div></div><p class="caption">Привычный язык помогает международной команде быстрее начать работу.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>16 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide closing" aria-label="17. Ваш главный помощник в поле."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">16 / ВАШ ПОЛЕВОЙ ПОМОЩНИК</span></div><h2>Ваш главный помощник в поле.</h2><p class="lead">Карты, геологические наблюдения и геохимический отбор в одном приложении.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Видеть полную картину</h3><p>Карты проекта, спутниковый обзор и высотные профили.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Сохранять детали</h3><p>Связанные наблюдения, пробы, фото и описания.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Продолжать работу</h3><p>Подготовленные офлайн-данные и удобная передача в офис.</p></div><p class="cta">Сосредоточьтесь на геологии. RS Field рядом.</p></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/16-1280.webp" alt="Your ultimate field companion." srcset="/presentations/field/16-640.webp 640w, /presentations/field/16-1280.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Возьмите данные своего проекта и оцените RS Field в работе вашей команды.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · RU · Октябрь 2026</span><span>17 / 17</span></footer></section>
      </div>
      <div class="deck active-deck" id="deck-en">
        <section class="slide cover active" aria-label="1. Rocksurv Field"><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">PRODUCT OVERVIEW</span></div><h1>Rocksurv<span>Field</span></h1><p class="tagline">A modern app for<br>geological and<br>geochemical fieldwork.</p><div class="hero-shot"><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/01-1920.webp" alt="Rocksurv Field" srcset="/presentations/field/01-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/01-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/01-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Maps, field records and terrain tools in one app.</p></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>01 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="2. Vector and raster data, together."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">01 / PROJECT MAPS</span></div><h2>Vector and raster data, together.</h2><p class="lead">Bring your project maps and routes into one field workspace.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Your project data</h3><p>Open local vector and raster layers from a GeoPackage.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Focus the map</h3><p>Use layer visibility, opacity, legends and feature identification.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Routes in context</h3><p>Import KML / KMZ routes alongside geological layers.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/02-1920.webp" alt="Vector and raster data, together." srcset="/presentations/field/02-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/02-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/02-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Project maps in one GeoPackage, managed directly in RS Field.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>02 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="3. Geology and geochemistry, together."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">02 / FIELD WORKFLOWS</span></div><h2>Geology and geochemistry, together.</h2><p class="lead">Choose the workflow that fits the survey before heading into the field.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Geological mapping</h3><p>Observations, structures, alteration, samples and media.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Geochemical collection</h3><p>Collect samples for mineral exploration using geochemical dispersion halos.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Shared field tools</h3><p>Keep maps, terrain tools and data protection in either workflow.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/03-1920.webp" alt="Geology and geochemistry, together." srcset="/presentations/field/03-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/03-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/03-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Set the workflow in Settings and keep the field toolbar focused on your route.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>03 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="4. Three record types in an Active Session"><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">03 / ACTIVE SESSION</span></div><h2>Three record types in an Active Session</h2><p class="lead">Keep detailed geological records connected to each field session.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Observation</h3><p>Location, rocks, composition, textures, samples, photos and notes.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Structure</h3><p>Planar and linear measurements with orientation and linked evidence.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Alteration / Mineralization</h3><p>Minerals, alteration types, intensity, form and geological context.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/04-1920.webp" alt="Three record types in an Active Session" srcset="/presentations/field/04-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/04-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/04-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">One session connects the observations and evidence collected along your route.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>04 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="5. Keep your bearing in the field."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">04 / FIELD ORIENTATION</span></div><h2>Keep your bearing in the field.</h2><p class="lead">Combine compass direction, GNSS position and geological context.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Compass heading</h3><p>Read degrees, cardinal direction and heading quality.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Position on the map</h3><p>Use an available GNSS fix and its reported accuracy.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Route planning</h3><p>Draw and save profile lines directly on the map.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/05-1920.webp" alt="Keep your bearing in the field." srcset="/presentations/field/05-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/05-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/05-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Keep direction, location and your survey map in one view.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>05 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="6. Smart classification, focused fields."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">05 / ROCK CLASSIFICATION</span></div><h2>Smart classification, focused fields.</h2><p class="lead">Rock type guides the choices available in each geological record.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Rock-name suggestions</h3><p>Geological rules use the selected type and entered composition.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Relevant choices</h3><p>Textures, components and characteristics fit the rock group.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Linked descriptions</h3><p>Build an editable draft from photo descriptions and references.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/06-1920.webp" alt="Smart classification, focused fields." srcset="/presentations/field/06-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/06-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/06-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Spend less time searching through unrelated fields and more time describing the outcrop.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>06 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="7. Measured structures, linked evidence."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">06 / STRUCTURAL GEOLOGY</span></div><h2>Measured structures, linked evidence.</h2><p class="lead">Record orientation and keep its geological context close at hand.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Planar and linear data</h3><p>Record dip direction, dip angle and lineation measurements.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Calculated strike</h3><p>Strike follows the British right-hand rule.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Automatic references</h3><p>Photo and sketch references support editable descriptions.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/07-1920.webp" alt="Measured structures, linked evidence." srcset="/presentations/field/07-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/07-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/07-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Keep each measurement connected to its observation and supporting images.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>07 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="8. Photos with geological detail."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">07 / PHOTO DOCUMENTATION</span></div><h2>Photos with geological detail.</h2><p class="lead">Keep visual evidence useful through clear descriptions and linked context.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Detailed photo notes</h3><p>Record geological features, scale and capture direction.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Context in templates</h3><p>Use rock, texture and structure values in descriptions.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Connected records</h3><p>Automatic photo/sketch links support observation and structure text.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/08-1280.webp" alt="Photos with geological detail." srcset="/presentations/field/08-640.webp 640w, /presentations/field/08-1280.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="1586" height="992" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Turn a field photo into a geological record that stays useful back in the office.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>08 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="9. Describe what you see in the field."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">08 / ALTERATION &amp; MINERALIZATION</span></div><h2>Describe what you see in the field.</h2><p class="lead">Capture alteration and mineralization in dedicated, connected records.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Alteration detail</h3><p>Record alteration type, intensity and form.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Mineralization detail</h3><p>Describe minerals, occurrence and geological relationships.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Spatial context</h3><p>Link an observation while retaining the point’s own coordinates.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/09-1920.webp" alt="Describe what you see in the field." srcset="/presentations/field/09-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/09-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/09-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Capture the details that matter while the outcrop is right in front of you.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>09 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="10. Satellite context, online or offline."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">09 / SATELLITE MAPS</span></div><h2>Satellite context, online or offline.</h2><p class="lead">Prepare an overview background for the area where your team will work.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Sentinel-2 RGB</h3><p>Natural-colour overview imagery: 2021 mosaic, 10 m pixels.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Choose your area</h3><p>Use the visible map or WGS84 bounds and set the download zoom.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Keep it offline</h3><p>Select a completed area to view its saved coverage without internet.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/10-1920.webp" alt="Satellite context, online or offline." srcset="/presentations/field/10-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/10-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/10-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Download your working area before departure and keep the landscape in view.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>10 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="11. Keep elevation available offline."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">10 / OFFLINE ELEVATION</span></div><h2>Keep elevation available offline.</h2><p class="lead">Use your contours or prepare open DEM data before departure.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Your own contours</h3><p>RS Field estimates elevation from your configured contour data.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Open DEM sources</h3><p>Download the required terrain coverage inside the app.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Contours with GNSS</h3><p>Combine contour-based elevation with an available GNSS height.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/11-1920.webp" alt="Keep elevation available offline." srcset="/presentations/field/11-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/11-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/11-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Prepare terrain once and keep heights at hand beyond mobile coverage.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>11 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="12. Save the line. Understand the terrain."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">11 / TERRAIN PROFILES</span></div><h2>Save the line. Understand the terrain.</h2><p class="lead">Build an elevation profile along a saved line using DEM or contours.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Reusable profile lines</h3><p>Save profiles; edit vertices, line colour and width.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Elevation in context</h3><p>Explore the chart and its linked position on the map.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Three distance measures</h3><p>Compare horizontal length, straight slopes and sampled terrain.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/12-1920.webp" alt="Save the line. Understand the terrain." srcset="/presentations/field/12-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/12-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/12-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">See how relief changes the distances along your proposed route.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>12 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="13. Geochemical exploration from plan to sample."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">12 / GEOCHEMICAL FIELDWORK</span></div><h2>Geochemical exploration from plan to sample.</h2><p class="lead">Geochemical sampling for mineral exploration using dispersion halos.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Plan and actual location</h3><p>Import CSV / point GeoPackage sites; confirm where sampling occurs.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Complete field context</h3><p>Record channel conditions, procedure, material, mass and fraction.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Single or composite</h3><p>Keep increments, materials and photos linked to their sample.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/13-1920.webp" alt="Geochemical exploration from plan to sample." srcset="/presentations/field/13-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/13-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/13-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Keep the sampling plan, field conditions and sample identity connected.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>13 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="14. Trace every sample through handover."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">13 / SAMPLE HANDOVER</span></div><h2>Trace every sample through handover.</h2><p class="lead">Keep control samples, batch versions and transfer records organised.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Control sample records</h3><p>Register duplicates, blanks and standards with their links.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Fixed batch versions</h3><p>Prepare materials, packages and recipient instructions.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Transfer and receipt</h3><p>Track selected items, discrepancies and retained corrections.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/14-1920.webp" alt="Trace every sample through handover." srcset="/presentations/field/14-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/14-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/14-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Know which materials were handed over, received or need follow-up.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>14 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide " aria-label="15. Make field data ready for handover."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">14 / FIELD TO OFFICE</span></div><h2>Make field data ready for handover.</h2><p class="lead">Export structured records and keep a recoverable field archive.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Geology export</h3><p>Excel, available photos/sketches and a validation report in a ZIP.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Geochemistry packages</h3><p>Separate the internal archive from the laboratory submission.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Data protection</h3><p>Saved-state feedback, change history and project backups.</p></div></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/15-1920.webp" alt="Make field data ready for handover." srcset="/presentations/field/15-800.webp 800w, /presentations/field/15-1280.webp 1280w, /presentations/field/15-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="2560" height="1410" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Hand over organised records while keeping a copy for your field team.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>15 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide language-slide" aria-label="16. An interface for international teams."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">15 / LANGUAGES &amp; PLATFORMS</span></div><h2>An interface for international teams.</h2><p class="lead">Switch interface language and keep the same field workflow.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>Instant localisation</h3><p>Choose English, Russian or Arabic in Settings.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Consistent field tools</h3><p>Use the same geological and geochemical workflows.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Platform availability</h3><p>Android tablet build demonstrated. iOS release to be confirmed.</p></div><div class="platforms"><div class="platform"><div class="platform-art android"><img src="/presentations/field/assets/android.svg" alt="Android" loading="lazy"></div><span>Android</span></div><div class="platform"><div class="platform-art ios"><img src="/presentations/field/assets/apple.svg" alt="iOS" loading="lazy"></div><span>iOS</span></div></div></div><div><div class="languages"><div class="lang-row"><img class="flag-background" src="/presentations/field/assets/flag_gb.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"><span>EN</span><strong lang="en" class="en" dir="ltr">English</strong></div><div class="lang-row"><img class="flag-background" src="/presentations/field/assets/flag_ru.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"><span>RU</span><strong lang="ru" class="ru" dir="ltr">Русский</strong></div><div class="lang-row"><img class="flag-background" src="/presentations/field/assets/flag_sa.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"><span>AR</span><strong lang="ar" class="ar" dir="rtl">العربية</strong></div></div><p class="caption">A familiar interface language helps international teams get straight to fieldwork.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>16 / 17</span></footer></section><section class="slide closing" aria-label="17. Your ultimate field companion."><div class="brandline"><span class="brand">RS Field</span><span class="eyebrow">16 / YOUR FIELD COMPANION</span></div><h2>Your ultimate field companion.</h2><p class="lead">Maps, geological records and geochemical sampling in one field app.</p><div class="feature-content"><div class="copy"><div class="point"><h3>See the full picture</h3><p>Project maps, satellite context and terrain profiles.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Capture every detail</h3><p>Connected observations, samples, photos and descriptions.</p></div><div class="point"><h3>Keep work moving</h3><p>Prepared offline data and structured office handover.</p></div><p class="cta">Focus on the geology. RS Field is at your side.</p></div><div><figure class="shot "><img src="/presentations/field/16-1280.webp" alt="Your ultimate field companion." srcset="/presentations/field/16-640.webp 640w, /presentations/field/16-1280.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 960px" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><p class="caption">Bring your project data and see how RS Field fits your team’s fieldwork.</p></div></div><footer class="footer"><span>Rocksurv Field · EN · October 2026</span><span>17 / 17</span></footer></section>
      </div>
